<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-ZAMALEK MAKE STRONG START IN CHAMPIONS' CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMALEK MAKE STRONG START IN CHAMPIONS' CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titleholders Zamalek of Egypt made a strong start in their opening match of the African Champions' Cup on Friday, beating St George of Ethiopia 2-0.</p>
